  "description": "A spacious one-bedroom home with everything you need to settle in from the start. The open-plan living area is light-filled and well-proportioned, anchored by a comfortable sofa, dining space and a contemporary Neff kitchen. The bedroom features generous fitted wardrobes and a painted feature wall that adds a touch of character. The en-suite bathroom is finished with a deluxe rainfall shower. Outside, your private balcony or terrace is yours to enjoy.",
